#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: scrollstage.php includes/blocks.php:24
msgid "Scrollstage"
msgstr "Scrollstage"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: scrollstage.php
msgid "https://joern.gorres.com/scrollstage"
msgstr "https://joern.gorres.com/scrollstage"

#. Description of the plugin
#: scrollstage.php
msgid ""
"Full-screen media that stay in place while text boxes scroll across them."
msgstr ""
"Bildschirmfüllende Medien, die an Ort und Stelle bleiben, während Textkästen "
"darüber scrollen."

#. Author of the plugin
#: scrollstage.php
msgid "Jörn Gorres"
msgstr "Jörn Gorres"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: scrollstage.php
msgid "https://joern.gorres.com"
msgstr "https://joern.gorres.com"

#: includes/templates.php:50
msgid "Scrollstage: full width"
msgstr "Scrollstage: volle Breite"

#. translators: %s: required PHP version
#: scrollstage.php:72
#, php-format
msgid "This plugin requires PHP %s or newer."
msgstr "Dieses Plugin benötigt PHP %s oder neuer."

#: scrollstage.php:76
msgid "Plugin activation stopped"
msgstr "Plugin-Aktivierung abgebrochen"

#: src/after/edit.js:33
msgid "Afterword"
msgstr "Nachspann"

#: src/after/edit.js:35
msgid ""
"The afterword always follows the last step. When the story limits the stage "
"to the medium, it appears right below the stage from the first step on and "
"only scrolls away once the story ends. Front end only."
msgstr ""
"Der Nachspann folgt immer auf den letzten Schritt. Wenn die Story die Bühne "
"auf das Medium begrenzt, erscheint er ab dem ersten Schritt direkt unter der "
"Bühne und scrollt erst weg, wenn die Story endet. Nur im Frontend."

#: src/step/edit.js:97
msgid "Replace medium"
msgstr "Medium ersetzen"

#: src/step/edit.js:103
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Medium"

#: src/step/edit.js:106
msgid ""
"No medium is set for this step. While scrolling, the medium of the previous "
"step stays in place."
msgstr ""
"Für diesen Schritt ist kein Medium festgelegt. Beim Scrollen bleibt das "
"Medium des vorherigen Schritts stehen."

#: src/step/edit.js:115
msgid ""
"This image has no alternative text. People using a screen reader will not "
"learn what it shows."
msgstr ""
"Dieses Bild hat keinen Alternativtext. Menschen, die einen Screenreader "
"nutzen, erfahren nicht, was es zeigt."

#: src/step/edit.js:125
msgid "Alternative text"
msgstr "Alternativtext"

#: src/step/edit.js:126
msgid "Leave empty to use the alternative text from the media library."
msgstr "Leer lassen, um den Alternativtext aus der Mediathek zu verwenden."

#: src/step/edit.js:140
msgid "Focal point"
msgstr "Fokuspunkt"

#: src/step/edit.js:141
msgid "Sets which point stays visible when the medium is cropped."
msgstr ""
"Legt fest, welcher Punkt sichtbar bleibt, wenn das Medium zugeschnitten wird."

#: src/step/edit.js:160
msgid "Remove medium"
msgstr "Medium entfernen"

#: src/step/edit.js:181
msgid "Medium of this step"
msgstr "Medium dieses Schritts"

#: src/step/edit.js:182
msgid "Choose an image or video for this text to scroll across."
msgstr "Wähle ein Bild oder Video, über das dieser Text scrollen soll."

#: src/story/edit.js:62
msgid "Text boxes"
msgstr "Textkästen"

#: src/story/edit.js:65
msgid "Horizontal position"
msgstr "Horizontale Position"

#: src/story/edit.js:69
msgid "Left"
msgstr "Links"

#: src/story/edit.js:73 src/story/edit.js:113
msgid "Middle"
msgstr "Mitte"

#: src/story/edit.js:77
msgid "Right"
msgstr "Rechts"

#: src/story/edit.js:87
msgid "Text box width in percent"
msgstr "Breite des Textkastens in Prozent"

#: src/story/edit.js:91
msgid "On narrow screens the boxes always use the full width."
msgstr "Auf schmalen Bildschirmen nutzen die Kästen immer die volle Breite."

#: src/story/edit.js:105
msgid "Vertical position"
msgstr "Vertikale Position"

#: src/story/edit.js:109
msgid "Top"
msgstr "Oben"

#: src/story/edit.js:117
msgid "Bottom"
msgstr "Unten"

#: src/story/edit.js:126
msgid "Media"
msgstr "Medien"

#: src/story/edit.js:129
msgid "Media fit"
msgstr "Anpassung der Medien"

#: src/story/edit.js:130
msgid ""
"“Fill the frame” crops the medium to the size of the screen, “Show the whole "
"medium” leaves margins free."
msgstr ""
"„Ausschnitt füllen“ schneidet das Medium auf die Bildschirmgröße zu, „Ganzes "
"Medium zeigen“ lässt Ränder frei."

#: src/story/edit.js:137
msgid "Fill the frame"
msgstr "Ausschnitt füllen"

#: src/story/edit.js:141
msgid "Show the whole medium"
msgstr "Ganzes Medium zeigen"

#: src/story/edit.js:155
msgid "Limit the stage to the medium"
msgstr "Bühne auf das Medium begrenzen"

#: src/story/edit.js:159
msgid ""
"Otherwise the media use the full width and the text can end up beside the "
"medium. The width follows the narrowest medium of the story. Front end only."
msgstr ""
"Andernfalls nutzen die Medien die volle Breite, und der Text kann neben dem "
"Medium landen. Die Breite richtet sich nach dem schmalsten Medium der Story. "
"Nur im Frontend."

#: src/story/edit.js:172
msgid "Pull up the following content"
msgstr "Folgenden Inhalt hochziehen"

#: src/story/edit.js:176
msgid ""
"The content after the story appears right below the stage from the first "
"step on and only scrolls on once the story ends. Front end only."
msgstr ""
"Der Inhalt nach der Story erscheint ab dem ersten Schritt direkt unter der "
"Bühne und scrollt erst weiter, wenn die Story endet. Nur im Frontend."

#: src/story/edit.js:188
msgid "Dimming in percent"
msgstr "Abdunkelung in Prozent"

#: src/story/edit.js:189
msgid "Sits on top of the media so that text stays readable."
msgstr "Liegt über den Medien, damit der Text lesbar bleibt."

#: src/story/edit.js:203
msgid "Offset from the top (px)"
msgstr "Abstand von oben (px)"

#: src/story/edit.js:207
msgid "Room for a fixed menu above the media."
msgstr "Platz für ein fixiertes Menü über den Medien."

#: src/story/edit.js:221
msgid "Step height in percent of the screen height"
msgstr "Schritthöhe in Prozent der Bildschirmhöhe"

#: src/story/edit.js:225
msgid "Decides how long a medium stays in place."
msgstr "Bestimmt, wie lange ein Medium stehen bleibt."

#: src/story/edit.js:239
msgid "Motion"
msgstr "Bewegung"

#: src/story/edit.js:244
msgid "Transition"
msgstr "Übergang"

#: src/story/edit.js:245
msgid ""
"With “None” the media switch instantly. Systems asking for reduced motion "
"never cross-fade."
msgstr ""
"Bei „Keiner“ wechseln die Medien sofort. Systeme, die reduzierte Bewegung "
"wünschen, blenden nie über."

#: src/story/edit.js:252
msgid "Cross-fade"
msgstr "Überblenden"

#: src/story/edit.js:256
msgid "None"
msgstr "Keiner"

#: src/after/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Scrollstage Afterword"
msgstr "Scrollstage-Nachspann"

#: src/after/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Content that follows the last step. With a stage limited to the medium it "
"sits right below the stage from the first step on."
msgstr ""
"Inhalt, der auf den letzten Schritt folgt. Bei einer auf das Medium "
"begrenzten Bühne sitzt er ab dem ersten Schritt direkt unter der Bühne."

#: src/after/block.json src/step/block.json src/story/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "scrollytelling"
msgstr "scrollytelling"

#: src/after/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "after"
msgstr "nachspann"

#: src/after/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "outro"
msgstr "outro"

#: src/after/block.json src/step/block.json src/story/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "story"
msgstr "story"

#: src/step/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Scrollstage Step"
msgstr "Scrollstage-Schritt"

#: src/step/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"One step of the story: text that scrolls across the medium belonging to it."
msgstr "Ein Schritt der Story: Text, der über das zugehörige Medium scrollt."

#: src/step/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "step"
msgstr "schritt"

#: src/story/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Scrollstage Story"
msgstr "Scrollstage-Story"

#: src/story/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"A full-screen medium that stays in place while the text steps scroll across "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Ein bildschirmfüllendes Medium, das an Ort und Stelle bleibt, während die "
"Textschritte darüber scrollen."

#: src/story/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "scroll"
msgstr "scroll"

#: src/story/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "sticky"
msgstr "sticky"
